<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Aletsch Glacier Trail: Moosfluh–Märjelensee–Fiescheralp — Moosfluh–Märjelensee–Tälligrattunnel–Fiescheralp</name><desc>From Moosfluh, follow the marked mountain trail via Biel and Hohbalm above the glacier, through the Grosses Gufer mountainside and Roti Chumme to Märjelensee. Return to the south side through the Tälligrattunnel and finish at Fiescheralp. Walk only in stable snow-free conditions and check the last cable-car services.

